# Legacy runtime artifact from the removed SelfImageWorker; still ignored so
# any stale local copy stays untracked. Aiko's self-model is now concept-driven.
# The human-authored persona (aiko_companion.txt) stays tracked.
data/persona/self_image.txt
data/*.db
data/*.db-shm
data/*.db-wal
# Anything derived from the database is the same personal data: chat history,
# memories, the concept graph. ``data/*.db`` only matches names *ending* in
# .db, so a pre-migration copy like chat_sessions.db.pre-l22-<stamp>.bak was
# untracked but not ignored -- one ``git add .`` from being published.
data/*.db.*
data/*.bak
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite3
models/
data/browser-profile/
*.wav
